WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
[Light instrumental music and soft pops]
Hover a date: how far off it is.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Hover a grade: its share.
7 of 10 points. 70%.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Hover cut-off text: all of it.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Hover a folder: what’s inside, done and due.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
[Sparkle sound]
Finish an item: a little burst.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Blackboard, with answers on hover.
